@baseUrl = http://localhost:5254
@token = replace-with-access-token
@customerId = 1
@documentId = 1
@serviceId = 1
@stageId = 1

### Assessor dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/Dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer approval queue with KYC document checklist
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/customers/approvals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer approval detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Verify an individual KYC document
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/customers/{{customerId}}/documents/{{documentId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "Verified",
  "notes": "KYC information and expiry checked."
}

### Approve, reject, or request customer changes
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/customers/{{customerId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "RequestChanges",
  "assessorNote": "Upload a current import license."
}

### Download customer KYC document
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/customers/{{customerId}}/documents/{{documentId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All assessment documents (service and customer KYC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/Documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Service review queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/service-reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### All active services
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assessor service workspace
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/services/{{serviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Service stages and uploaded stage documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/services/{{serviceId}}/stages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assign a service or stage risk channel
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/services/risk-channel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipmentId": {{serviceId}},
  "stageId": {{stageId}},
  "riskChannel": "Yellow",
  "notes": "Review required handling controls."
}

### Submit a service or stage assessment decision
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/services/assessment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serviceId": {{serviceId}},
  "stageId": {{stageId}},
  "decision": "NeedsReview",
  "taxAmount": 0,
  "dutyAmount": 0,
  "assessorNote": "Verify the supporting evidence."
}

### Assessment audit log
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Assessor/AssessmentLogs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer uploads a KYC document (replace path with a local PDF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Customer/UploadKycDocument
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=KycDocumentBoundary

--KycDocumentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

Business License
--KycDocumentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="expiresAt"

2027-11-25
--KycDocumentBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="business-license.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\path\to\business-license.pdf
--KycDocumentBoundary--

### Staff or customer uploads a KYC document for a customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/Customers/{{customerId}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=CustomerKycBoundary

--CustomerKycBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

Business License
--CustomerKycBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="business-license.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< C:\path\to\business-license.pdf
--CustomerKycBoundary--
